:: MP Extra Job Supplement Hub [nobr]
<<if not $mpSupplementBrowse>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<else>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><</if>><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpSupplementBrowse to 1>>
高街零工招工木牌背面挂着一册四季班次与日常插曲备忘录。前半册记着咖啡馆、海礁鱼档、桑拿房、农场、钟表铺与孤儿院浆洗房的新增班次记录，后半册则记着另外六条营生。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回木牌 (0:02)|MP Extra Jobs Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[翻到后半册 (0:02)|MP Extra Job Seasonal Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpstallicon>><<link [[查看咖啡馆鱼档 (0:08)|MP Job Seasonal Cafe Spring]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看桑拿房农场 (0:08)|MP Job Seasonal Spa Spring]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[查看钟表铺浆洗房 (0:02)|MP Job Seasonal Clock Spring]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

