:: MP Job Seasonal Cafe Spring [nobr]
<<if not $mpSupplementBrowse>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<else>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><</if>>
春分前后的海风带着微潮的花粉吹进海风咖啡馆，窗台上新摆了几瓶沾露的黄水仙。早市客人比往常多点了清淡的接骨木花茶。
<<if ($upperwet or 0) gte 1>>你的袖口沾着晨雨，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>递给你一条烘暖的亚麻巾，让你先把托盘擦干。<<stress -1>><<else>>你手脚麻利地把窗边水仙瓶摆正，顺手替常客添上温水。<</if>>
<<if !$mpSupplementBrowse && window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_seasonal_cafe_spring")>>
你收下窗边常客压在茶碟下的春茶硬币。<span class="gold">你获得了 £1.50 春日茶座小费。</span>
<<money 600>>
<<else>>
你把吧台上的水仙花瓶摆正，转身接手下一桌点单。
<</if>>
<<if $mpSupplementBrowse>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合上备忘录 (0:08)|MP Extra Job Supplement Hub]]>><<set $mpSupplementBrowse to 0>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[翻下一条 (0:02)|MP Job Seasonal Cafe Summer]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Seasonal Cafe Summer [nobr]
<<if not $mpSupplementBrowse>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<else>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><</if>>
盛夏午后的阳光把咖啡馆露台晒得发烫，碎冰机在吧台后嗡嗡作响。客人们纷纷要加薄荷叶的冰柠檬水。
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>入夜后海风转凉，你替露台客人点起驱蚊香茅烛，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在账本上给你多记了一笔。<<stress -1>><<else>>正午热浪扑面，你端着冰水穿梭在卡座间，额角沁出细汗。<</if>>
<<if !$mpSupplementBrowse && window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_seasonal_cafe_summer")>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>从冰桶旁点出一枚硬币塞进你手心。<span class="gold">你获得了 £1.50 露台消暑小费。</span>
<<money 600>>
<<else>>
海风吹过咖啡馆露台，散去了你额角的薄汗。
<</if>>
<<if $mpSupplementBrowse>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合上备忘录 (0:08)|MP Extra Job Supplement Hub]]>><<set $mpSupplementBrowse to 0>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[翻下一条 (0:02)|MP Job Random Cafe 1]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

