:: MP Job Seasonal Fish Spring [nobr]
<<if not $mpSupplementBrowse>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<else>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><</if>>
春汛退潮后的海礁浅湾里游动着成群的银鳞春鲹，湿润的海雾里满是新长海带的咸鲜气。
<<if ($upperwet or 0) gte 1>>你的裤腿被春潮浸湿，老渔夫扔给你一双防滑草套鞋。<<stress -1>><<else>>你踩着干爽的礁盘抛出鱼线，浮漂在春水里稳稳立住。<</if>>
<<if !$mpSupplementBrowse && window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_seasonal_fish_spring")>>
老渔夫分给你一枚沾着鱼鳞的春汛银币。<span class="gold">你拿到了 £1.50 春汛分鱼补贴。</span>
<<money 600>>
<<else>>
你把海礁边的竹篓系牢，继续盯着海面浮漂。
<</if>>
<<if $mpSupplementBrowse>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合上备忘录 (0:10)|MP Extra Job Supplement Hub]]>><<set $mpSupplementBrowse to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[翻下一条 (0:02)|MP Job Seasonal Fish Summer]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

