:: MP Job Seasonal Trawler Summer [nobr]
<<if not $mpSupplementBrowse>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<else>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><</if>>
盛夏近海风平浪静，渔船改在清晨与黄昏两头出航，船舱底铺满了碎冰块用来镇住鲜虾与墨鱼。
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夏夜返航时星河低垂，你在船头帮忙校准罗盘灯，海风咸爽怡人。<<stress -1>><<else>>正午甲板晒得滚烫，你提来海水冲凉甲板木板，免得晒裂捻缝。<</if>>
<<if !$mpSupplementBrowse && window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_seasonal_trawler_summer")>>
收鲜虾的港商在甲板上多留了一枚补贴硬币。<span class="gold">你领到了 £1.50 夏航冰鲜补贴。</span>
<<money 600>>
<<else>>
近海咸爽的晚风吹散了甲板上的太阳余温。
<</if>>
<<if $mpSupplementBrowse>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合上备忘录 (0:10)|MP Extra Job Supplement Hub]]>><<set $mpSupplementBrowse to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[翻下一条 (0:02)|MP Job Random Trawler 4]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Random Trawler 4 [nobr]
<<if not $mpSupplementBrowse>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<else>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><</if>>
起网滑轮的副麻绳在船舷滚筒边磨起了一团毛刺，再拉一网恐怕会断。
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
你趁放网间隙迅速用蜡线缠紧磨损处并垫上帆布护套，消除了隐患。<span class="green">渔船在涌浪间稳稳当当地保持着航向。</span><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
船身随浪一晃，麻绳毛刺擦红了你的虎口，只得先降下主帆减速。<span class="red">摇晃的甲板让你双腿有些发软。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<<if $mpSupplementBrowse>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合上备忘录 (0:10)|MP Extra Job Supplement Hub]]>><<set $mpSupplementBrowse to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[翻下一条 (0:02)|MP Job Random Trawler 5]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Random Trawler 5 [nobr]
<<if not $mpSupplementBrowse>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<else>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><</if>>
一尾被捞上甲板的大墨鱼突然喷出一股浓黑墨汁，直奔海图室的玻璃窗。
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
你眼疾手快地举起木水桶挡在窗前，再用海水一冲便干干净净。<span class="green">水手们齐声喝彩，甲板上一片欢腾。</span><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
墨汁溅了你半边围裙，你在甲板上搓洗了好一会儿才洗淡。<span class="red">海浪打湿了围裙，你多费了一番力气。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<<if $mpSupplementBrowse>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合上备忘录 (0:10)|MP Extra Job Supplement Hub]]>><<set $mpSupplementBrowse to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
